title: Eastern Expedition
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/ChenJiongming.jpg
tags: warlord_affairs
view-if: eastexped_timer = 0 and eastexped_active = 1
on-arrival: {!

Q.week_actions += 1;
Q.eastexped_timer += 3;
Q.firsttrialdone = 0;
Q.secondtrialdone = 0;
Q.chen_strength = 50;
Q.chen_militancy = 0.2;
Q.nrapower = Q.nra_strength*Q.nra_militancy;
Q.chenpower = Q.chen_strength*Q.chen_militancy;

!}

= The Eastern Expedition

We finally have a chance to defeat Chen Jiongming in battle. Now, it's time to march east!

- @firsttrial: March into Huizhou.
- @secondtrial: March into Shanwei.
- @root: We need more time to prepare!
- @easy_discard

@firsttrial
choose-if: firsttrialdone = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Huizhou has fallen into our hands.
go-to: losehuizhou if nrapower < chenpower; winhuizhou if nrapower >= chenpower

@winhuizhou
on-arrival: nra_strength -= 10; chen_strength -= 20; firsttrialdone = 1;

We have defeated Chen Jiongming in Huizhou and have inflicted large casualties against his army! This is a cause to celebrate.

- @done: Hurrah!

@done
go-to: main

@donelose
go-to: main

@losehuizhou
on-arrival: nra_strength -= 20; chen_strength -= 10;

Chen Jiongming's armies have defeated us! We have been repelled back to our starting position.

- @donelose: Unfortunate.

@secondtrial
choose-if: firsttrialdone = 1
unavailable-subtitle: We must march into Huizhou before reaching Shanwei.
go-to: loseshanwei if nrapower < chenpower; winshanwei if nrapower >= chenpower

@winshanwei
on-arrival: nra_strength -= 10; chen_strength -= 20; secondtrialdone = 1; eastexped_active = 0; eastexped_done = 1;

We have defeated Chen Jiongming in Shanwei and have sent him all the way to Shantou! This is a great victory for us.

- @done: Hurrah!

@loseshanwei
on-arrival: nra_strength -= 20; chen_strength -= 10; firsttrialdone = 0;

Chen Jiongming's armies have defeated us! We have been repelled back to our starting position.

- @donelose: Unfortunate.
